{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "今日费用 · 11 微档(2026-10-04):一个数 = 今天按 API 标价折算的费用(c11,≤ 5 字符,字号 c11F 由流给);底行 = 到了近 30 天日均的多少(与 22 档「今天与日均」同一个 w.vsAvg.pct)。\n⚠️ 低于日均也只陈述百分比、不下「比平常少」的判断 —— 今天还没过完(同 today 组件 cmpLvl=0 档的理由)。没有日均(用了不到几天)时底行写「按 API 标价」交代口径。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "今日费用",
        "avgA": "日均的 ",
        "avgB": "%",
        "api": "按 API 标价"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Today",
        "avgA": "",
        "avgB": "% of avg",
        "api": "API prices"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "今日费用 · 11 微档(2026-10-04):一个数 = 今天按 API 标价折算的费用(c11,≤ 5 字符,字号 c11F 由流给);底行 = 到了近 30 天日均的多少(与 22 档「今天与日均」同一个 w.vsAvg.pct)。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "8pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "17pt",
        "y": "7pt",
        "w": "43pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${c11}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "22pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${c11}",
            "fontSize": "${c11F}pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${c11}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "28pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.vsAvg.pct}),k),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${w.vsAvg.has},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "sub",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.avgA}${w.vsAvg.pct}${@i18n.avgB}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.vsAvg.pct}),k),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${w.vsAvg.has},1),1,0),0),1),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${live},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.api}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.vsAvg.pct}),k),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${w.vsAvg.has},1),1,0),0),1),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${live},1),0,1),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "avgA"
    ]
  }
}